# Mods sync

- Manifesto: `app/runtime/mods/mods-manifest.json`
- Entrypoints: `python run.py`, `python -m presentation.cli`, `make docker-sync-mods`
- Sources: Modrinth (API ou `download_url`) e CurseForge (`download_url` obrigatorio)
- JAR local com hash valido → skip; hash invalido → redownload; mismatch pos-download → falha
- JARs nao entram no Git
- Doc: `docs/arquitetura.md`, `docs/configuration.md`; skill: `mcs-mods-sync`
